      "CYNTHIA: God, they totally threw me, they were such assholes.\nLISA: Cynthia, there are no guests who are assholes, only guests with \"special needs.\" Cynthia smiles. Lisa\"s cab rolls to a stop at the terminal.…",
      "LISA: All I get is that this is wrong --\nSENIOR FLT. ATTENDANT: How\"s she doing?",
      "GATE ATTENDANT: Security to gate 24. White female, dark blue sweater, heading towards baggage claim -- She turns to look, but in these few seconds, Lisa has…\nLISA: Morning, hi, I\"m Wendy with airport food service. Just wondering how you'd rate our muffins? The girls exchange looks and shrugs.",
      "CYNTHIA: Lux Atlantic, this is •••\nLISA: Cynthia, put me through to Keefe\"s room! INTERCUT:",
      "CYNTHIA: Lisa, what's going on --\nLISA: PUT ME THROUGH!\nCYNTHIA: Okay, okay, I'm so sorry -- We hear a RING. Then -- the voice of the hotel answering system:"
    ]
